---@field LabelSize? aws.geo_maps.LabelSize|string Overrides the label size auto-calculated by FileName. Takes in one of the values - Small or Large.
---@field Language? aws.geo_maps.LanguageTag Specifies the language on the map labels using the BCP 47 language tag, limited to ISO 639-1 two-letter language codes. If the specified language data isn't available for the map image, the labels will default to the regional primary language.
---@field Padding? aws.geo_maps.SensitiveInteger|distilled.Secret Applies additional space (in pixels) around overlay feature to prevent them from being cut or obscured.
