---@field FileName string The map scaling parameter to size the image, icons, and labels. It follows the pattern of ^map(@2x)?$.
---@field ScaleBarUnit? aws.geo_maps.ScaleBarUnit|string Displays a scale on the bottom right of the map image with the unit specified in the input.
